  "sentences": [
    {
      "key": "s0_cover_0",
      "scene": 0,
      "text": "轮船是钢铁做的，螺母也是钢铁做的，一个浮在水上，一个沉到水底。",
      "audio": "audio/s0_cover_0.mp3",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 6.304,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 6.304
    },
    {
      "key": "s0_cover_1",
      "scene": 0,
      "text": "差别不在材料，在水往上托的那个力。",
      "audio": "audio/s0_cover_1.mp3",
      "start": 6.604,
      "end": 9.904,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 3.3
    },
    {
      "key": "s1_what_0",
      "scene": 1,
      "text": "浸在液体或者气体里的物体，会受到一个向上的力，这个力叫浮力。",
      "audio": "audio/s1_what_0.mp3",
      "start": 10.654,
      "end": 17.214,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 6.56
    },
    {
      "key": "s1_what_1",
      "scene": 1,
      "text": "浮力有多大，等于物体排开的那部分液体的重量。",
      "audio": "audio/s1_what_1.mp3",
      "start": 17.514,
      "end": 21.694,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 4.18
    },
    {
      "key": "s1_what_2",
      "scene": 1,
      "text": "教材原话就是这么写的。",
      "audio": "audio/s1_what_2.mp3",
      "start": 21.994,
      "end": 24.194,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 2.2
    },
    {
      "key": "s2_page_0",
      "scene": 2,
      "text": "这是教材原书上的那一页。",
      "audio": "audio/s2_page_0.mp3",
      "start": 24.944,
      "end": 26.906,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 1.962
    },
    {
      "key": "s2_page_1",
      "scene": 2,
      "text": "翻到人教版八年级下册第十章，第 49 页，这页开头就是浮力的定义，和那个冰山的例子。",
      "audio": "audio/s2_page_1.mp3",
      "start": 27.206,
      "end": 35.646,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 8.44
    },
    {
      "key": "s3_chain_0",
      "scene": 3,
      "text": "学浮力之前得先会三样，重力、力、还有液体压强。",
      "audio": "audio/s3_chain_0.mp3",
      "start": 36.396,
      "end": 42.747,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 6.351
    },
    {
      "key": "s3_chain_1",
      "scene": 3,
      "text": "因为浮力说到底，是上表面和下表面压力差出来的。",
      "audio": "audio/s3_chain_1.mp3",
      "start": 43.047,
      "end": 47.134,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 4.087
    },
    {
      "key": "s4_end_0",
      "scene": 4,
      "text": "浮力看明白了，再往下就是阿基米德原理和物体的浮沉条件。",
      "audio": "audio/s4_end_0.mp3",
      "start": 47.884,
      "end": 52.911,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 5.027
    },
    {
      "key": "s4_end_1",
      "scene": 4,
      "text": "学习页里还有教材例题和完整的前置链。",
      "audio": "audio/s4_end_1.mp3",
      "start": 53.211,
      "end": 56.88,
      "est": false,
      "dur": 3.669
    }
